LIBRCEKUNIT - COMPLETE API REFERENCE
=====================================

Library for interacting with the "cekunit" admin panel. Provides an HTTP client
with automatic cookie management, CSRF token extraction/injection, and
pre‑defined endpoints for all application resources.

Version: 2.0.0
License: AGPL-3.0
Repository: https://codeberg.org/mroczect/librcekunit.git

IMPORTANT: This library is NOT published on crates.io. Installation must be
done directly from the GitHub repository. See Section 1 for details.


